                <pb facs="0054" n="34" sameAs="frus:frus1864p3/pg34"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <p>“It is affirmed that a contract has been entered into between the Juarist
                    authorities of the state of Tamaulipas and the federal authorities, in virtue of
                    which the latter were to furnish a certain quantity of arms and munitions of
                    war, in return for the delivery of several thousands of Mexican mules.”</p>
            </div>
